{"id":"b69b13179ecbdd3e","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability.md","title":"公理及规则翻译推出定理翻译","display":"prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability — 公理及规则翻译推出定理翻译","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability","aliases":["91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability","91-prop-theory-translation","91-prop-intertranslatable"],"display":"prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability — 公理及规则翻译推出定理翻译","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-strength]]","[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability</span><span>91-prop-theory-translation</span><span>91-prop-intertranslatable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability — 公理及规则翻译推出定理翻译"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d84df7f701355c56\" href=\"?note=d84df7f701355c56\" title=\"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence\">91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,U\">\\(S,U\\)</span> 为有限规则、可递归公理化的演算，公理和规则包含各自逻辑部分；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是保持句子合式性的可计算翻译。</li>\n<li>对每个 S 公理已有有效产生的 U 证明，其结论为该公理的 τ 翻译；每个 S 规则实例已有有效程序，把其前提的 U 翻译证明转成其结论的 U 翻译证明。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 反方向满足同样条件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为共同句子类，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\varphi)=\\rho(\\varphi)=\\varphi\">\\(\\tau(\\varphi)=\\rho(\\varphi)=\\varphi\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}intertranslatability}\\vdash\\quad\nS\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow U\\vdash\\tau(\\sigma),\\qquad\nU\\vdash\\psi\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\rho(\\psi),\\qquad S\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}intertranslatability}\\vdash\\quad\nS\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow U\\vdash\\tau(\\sigma),\\qquad\nU\\vdash\\psi\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\rho(\\psi),\\qquad S\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对有限证明树归纳：叶结点用公理翻译证明，内部结点用规则翻译程序，根结点得到所需结论。共同句的翻译为恒等，因而两向给后果集合等式。\n旧稿的主要结论只是把已经假定的全定理保持与可逆性重述为 BiTrans；又在没有定义等价的完整消去、唯一性条件时断言 DefEq。现只给可实施的局部验证准则及它实际推出的证明结论。\n两个相反翻译不自动互为可证逆，互可解释也不自动定义等价。KF 与 VF 算术后果不同，因此不能拥有这里同时固定全部算术句的双向证明翻译。</p>\n<p>来源：§6 的强度/解释区别、Theorem 8.35 的翻译动机；证明树归纳准则为本地一般引理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"d84df7f701355c56","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\varphi)=\\rho(\\varphi)=\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}intertranslatability}\\vdash\\quad\nS\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow U\\vdash\\tau(\\sigma),\\qquad\nU\\vdash\\psi\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\rho(\\psi),\\qquad S\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}U.","display":true}],"bytes":2028,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability]]"}],"outgoing":["c87db4d1858a0009","d84df7f701355c56"]}